  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n7+ {4 + 3 of 4 - (5 + 3 - 6 ÷ 2)}\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n7+ {4 + 3 of 4 - (5 + 3 - 6 ÷ 2)}\n\n⇒ 7 + {4 + 3 × 4 - (5 + 3 - 3)}\n\n⇒ 7 + {4 + 12 - (8 - 3)}\n\n⇒ 7 + {4 + 12 - 5}\n\n⇒ 7 + {16 - 5}\n\n⇒ 7 + 11\n\n⇒ 18\n\n**∴ Option 1 is the correct answer.**",
